Hello all,

 =


I'm interested in running the integration tests and unit tests for the tpm2
software stack (tss, abrm, and the tools).

 =


Is there any documentation on the switches to use with configure and make to
run those tests? Unfortunately, I couldn't find it.

 =


Also, are those tests hard coded to use the IBM tpm2 simulator? I noticed
that tpm2-abrmd allows you to test against the hardware tpm. Is it possible
to configure these tests to use the mssim tcti with non-default configs?

 =


thank you,

 =


Safayet


